  "description": "Hwang Min-Ki, who had been keeping a safe distance from people due to his obsessive-compulsive disorder, is suddenly kicked out of his house one day and ends up moving into a company dormitory. However, his roommate is none other than Lee Hyun-Seong, a junior in the same department who is notorious for being dirty...! Min-Ki cannot stand Hyun-Seong's dirty appearance and the room that smells like trash, so he takes him to the bathroom and pours water on him.\n\n *\"No, senior! I'm so sensitive that I get goosebumps just from the feeling of washing foam!!!\"*\n\nWhat should he do with this junior with this absurd constitution?\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
